        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Harry Ransom, Steven J. Kachelmeier\n- Organizations: University of Texas System, University of Kansas\n- Roles: Chancellor, Ph.D. graduate\n- Places: Texas, Kansas\n\nFacts:\n- Harry Ransom served as Chancellor of the University of Texas System from 1961 to 1971.\n- Steven J. Kachelmeier earned his Ph.D. from the University of Kansas.\n- The University of Texas System and the University of Kansas together have a combined campus area of 2,000 acres and more than 216,000 students.",
